{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ONxKLulttd1794537496.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>外交部宣布，國家主席習近平下周將出席在深圳舉行的亞太經合組織峰會。</p><p></p><p>習近平下周三至周四，出席APEC第33次領導人非正式會議，主題是「建設亞太共同體，促進共同繁榮」，習近平將主持會議並發表講話。</p><p></p><p>而APEC工商領導人峰會下周二和周三舉行，習近平會出席開幕式，並作主旨演講。</p><p></p><p>會議期間，習近平亦將為與會各經濟體領導人或代表舉行歡迎宴會，並同外國領導人舉行雙邊會晤。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T03:03:51.073015+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T01:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:34:43.165731+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T02:57:13.976950+00:00","content_hash":"bea97853d274fd0f4c71f04b0abe9d891897b6d928ac98fbcde8df532e5038c6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T03:03:51.073015+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}